    {
      "крок": "опис",
      "збій": {
        "вид": "схема",
        "частина": "розбір",
        "поле": "wrong_photos",
        "що": "item outside outfit",
        "сирий": "{\"version\":\"1\",\"text\":\"For your office day, I built this around the dress you asked for: a black dress, calf length, with a mid-range formality that suits work. Black isn't among your palette colours, so I'm using it as a neutral base. I'm bringing colour closer to your face with the chocolate scarf and the milky earrings. A trench goes over the dress as the autumn layer. The loafers and the leather tote stay in black so the look reads as one quiet, work-ready whole.\",\"how_to_wear\":[\"Wear the dress with the trench over it. Wear the scarf around your neck, under or inside the trench's lapels, so the chocolate sits near your face.\",\"Put the earrings in last. The milky tone repeats the light note by your face and keeps the scarf from being the only accent there.\",\"The loafers and the bag stay in black, matching the dress, so the colour you add is only at the neck and ears.\"],\"wrong_photos\":[\"#121·05: the catalogue photo shows a light beige trench, but the card says it is black. I haven't judged the trench's colour from the photo.\"],\"about_items\":[{\"n\":\"#860·03\",\"text\":\"The dress is the base of the look and answers your request for a dress. It is calf length, and its formality range of 4–6 sits comfortably in an office. Black is outside your palette, so I'm using it as a neutral and keeping your colours at the neck and ears.\"},{\"n\":\"#1373·06\",\"text\":\"Leather loafers with a 4 cm heel. Their formality range of 4–6 matches the dress, so they work for a full day in the office. They are black, which ties them to the dress and the bag.\"},{\"n\":\"#530·07\",\"text\":\"A black leather tote with a slight sheen. It is a practical, plain work bag that echoes the black of the dress and shoes without adding another focal point.\"},{\"n\":\"#121·05\",\"text\":\"A trench as the outer layer over the dress, for autumn. Its formality range of 5–8 is a little higher than the dress, which suits the office. The catalogue photo doesn't match the card colour, so check it before you rely on it.\"},{\"n\":\"#184·10\",\"text\":\"A chocolate-brown scarf. It is the main colour in the look, worn at the neck close to your face, where a warm brown softens the black base. The scarf's size isn't specified, so I'm keeping to a simple drape rather than a particular knot.\"},{\"n\":\"#4·12\",\"text\":\"Milky-toned earrings. They add a light accent beside your face, which lifts the black and the brown and keeps the look polished for work.\"}]}",
        "спроба": 1,
